                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An absolutely wonderful game!\nWhen looking for cheap bargain bin games, I stumbled upon this one. Since it's so cheap, I thought it wouldn't be that good. However, I'm mistaken. \nThis fast paced bullet hell is insanely fun to retry over and over again not only for a highscore, but also for the achievements!\nThis is a game that I absolutely recommend you to try out right now! It is worth more then what it's priced at.\nCan't wait for the next game in the series!",
